# Title: File Download Via Nscurl - MacOS
# ID: 6d8a7cf1-8085-423b-b87d-7e880faabbdf
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Daniel Cortez
# Date: 2024-06-04
# Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1105
# Description: Detects the execution of the nscurl utility in order to download files.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(process.executable:*/nscurl AND (process.command_line:*--download * OR process.command_line:*--download-directory * OR process.command_line:*--output * OR process.command_line:*-dir * OR process.command_line:*-dl * OR process.command_line:*-ld* OR process.command_line:*-o *))
